&lt;p&gt;This engagement involves participation in AI data collection and evaluation. Services include providing audio, video, image, and written inputs—including recordings of your voice and likeness—to support the development and refinement of AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eligibility for this project requires that you are 18 years or older and agree to the applicable participant and consent agreements.&lt;/p&gt;
